one will buy them.  The city has no plan for when everyone disappears and stops maintain half mile high buildings. Everyone Elseleft to deal with the disaster. <a href=\"https://x.com/MoundLore/status/2010894536768438616\">Tweet by @MoundLore</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/MoundLore/status/2010894536768438616\">https://x.com/MoundLore/status/2010894536768438616</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 2075228065307734116</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/2075228065307734116\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2026-07-09T14:38:21Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"2075229069927383136":{"a":"<p>Half mile? 1000ft tall building needs 1000 ft deep foundation to balance it. Sometimes they fake it and the buildings tilt. Sometimes the foundation is fine but they forgot wind can hit two or more sides of a building at once; miscalculating load stresses by factor of 2-4x. 🤷🏼‍♂️</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/2075228065307734116\">https://x.com/i/status/2075228065307734116</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 2075229069927383136</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/2075229069927383136\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2026-07-09T14:42:20Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"2075232235863630041":{"a":"<p>@MoundLore Bigger issue imho is that the exhibits in the building were created without consulting anyone who knows anything about local culture. They don&#x27;t really have any artifacts to begin with. Just a bunch of cavemen in cartoon clothing.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/2075185350842937379\">https://x.com/i/status/2075185350842937379</a></blockq